  "body": "## Changes since 2.04.02\n[**Full Changelog**](https://github.com/JianZcar/FuzPad/compare/2.04.02...2.05.00)\n\n* Update README.md by @JianZcar in [c9796d3](https://github.com/JianZcar/FuzPad/commit/c9796d395ceb65626af8f801f254da38526a7890)\n* feat: comply with XDG specifications by @Fruchix in [a3e19ca](https://github.com/JianZcar/FuzPad/commit/a3e19cadfe44e234c57f38ea4838e63122f90563)\n  Notes will be stored under:\n  - \\`$XDG\\_DATA\\_HOME/fuzpad/notes\\` if $XDG\\_DATA\\_HOME is set\n  - \\`$HOME/.local/share/fuzpad/notes\\` else\n  This location can be overriden by explicitely setting \\`$FUZPAD\\_DIR\\` to another directory (that exists or not).\n* docs: update FUZPAD_DIR configuration by @Fruchix in [4f696a8](https://github.com/JianZcar/FuzPad/commit/4f696a8cfe9011fdfa53c59627f4ccaf4fe6ddce)\n\n## New Contributors 🚀\n\n@Fruchix\n",
